@startuml UC-08: Manajemen User (Admin Only)

title UC-08: Manajemen User oleh Admin\nSistem Smart Aquaponic

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 230
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #2C7BE5
    ActorBorderColor #2C7BE5
    LifeLineBorderColor #2C7BE5
    ParticipantBorderColor #2C7BE5
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #EBF4FF
    ActorBackgroundColor #EBF4FF
    GroupBackgroundColor #F0F4FF
    GroupBorderColor #ADC8FF
}

actor       "Admin"                         as Admin
boundary    "UserManagementPage (UI)"       as UI
control     "UserController"               as UC
control     "RoleMiddleware"               as MW
entity      "Users <<database>>"           as DB

== Middleware: Proteksi Route Admin Only ==

note over MW : Semua route /users dilindungi oleh\nmiddleware(['auth', 'role:admin'])

== UC-08a: Lihat Daftar User ==

Admin ->  UI  : GET /users
activate UI
UI    ->  MW  : Cek session auth + role = 'admin'
activate MW
alt Tidak Terautentikasi atau Bukan Admin
    MW   -->  UI  : redirect('/login') atau abort(403)
    UI   -->  Admin : Halaman 403 / redirect ke login
else Terautentikasi sebagai Admin
    MW   -->  UI  : Lanjutkan ke controller
    deactivate MW
    UI    ->  UC  : index()
    activate UC
    UC    ->  DB  : User::latest()->get()
    activate DB
    DB   -->  UC  : Daftar semua user
    deactivate DB
    UC   -->  UI  : view('admin.users.index', users)
    deactivate UC
    UI   -->  Admin : Tampilkan tabel user (nama, email, role, status)
end
deactivate UI

== UC-08b: Tambah User Baru ==

Admin ->  UI  : Klik "Tambah User" → Isi form (nama, email, role, password)
activate UI
UI    ->  UC  : POST /users {name, email, phone_number, role, password}
activate UC

UC    ->  UC  : validate({name: required,\nemail: required|email|unique:users,\nphone_number: nullable,\nrole: required|in:admin,user,\npassword: required|min:6})

alt Validasi Gagal
    UC   -->  UI  : redirect back()->withErrors()->withInput()
    UI   -->  Admin : Tampilkan pesan error validasi
else Validasi Berhasil
    UC    ->  DB  : User::create({name, email, phone_number, role,\nstatus: 'active',\npassword: Hash::make(password)})
    activate DB
    DB   -->  UC  : User tersimpan (bcrypt hash password)
    deactivate DB
    UC   -->  UI  : redirect('/users')->with('success', 'User berhasil ditambahkan')
    UI   -->  Admin : Flash sukses, kembali ke daftar user
end

deactivate UC
deactivate UI

== UC-08c: Update Data User ==

Admin ->  UI  : Klik "Edit" → Ubah data user → Submit
activate UI
UI    ->  UC  : PUT /users/{user} {name, email, phone_number, role, status}
activate UC

UC    ->  UC  : validate({name: required,\nemail: required|email,\nphone_number: nullable,\nrole: required|in:admin,user,\nstatus: required|in:active,inactive})

alt Validasi Gagal
    UC   -->  UI  : redirect back()->withErrors()->withInput()
    UI   -->  Admin : Tampilkan pesan error validasi
else Validasi Berhasil
    UC    ->  DB  : $user->update({name, email, phone_number, role, status})
    activate DB
    DB   -->  UC  : Data user diperbarui
    deactivate DB
    UC   -->  UI  : redirect('/users')->with('success', 'User berhasil diperbarui')
    UI   -->  Admin : Flash sukses, data user terupdate
end

deactivate UC
deactivate UI

== UC-08d: Hapus User ==

Admin ->  UI  : Klik "Hapus" pada user tertentu
activate UI
UI    ->  UC  : DELETE /users/{user}
activate UC

UC    ->  DB  : $user->delete() (Soft delete / Hard delete)
activate DB
DB   -->  UC  : User dihapus
deactivate DB

UC   -->  UI  : redirect('/users')->with('success', 'User berhasil dihapus')
deactivate UC
UI   -->  Admin : Flash sukses, user hilang dari daftar
deactivate UI

@enduml
